    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your attacks channel your fell will.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Hex class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Once per round, when you successfully make a melee attack as part of an attack action against a creature, you may use one of your hexes on that creature as a swift action that does not provoke attacks of opportunity from the target.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/general-feats#toc38\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
